---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../site';
---
<PageLayout title="About" description={`What ${SITE_NAME} is, who maintains it, how cases are researched and checked, and how AI tools are used in making the site.`} updated="2026-11-01">
  <p>{SITE_NAME} publishes a <a href="/">library of real AI startup cases</a>, organised by <a href="/industries/">industry</a> and <a href="/types/">product type</a>. Each case records founders, launch date, team size and revenue, with every number linked to a dated source.</p>
  <h2>Who maintains this site</h2>
  <p>The site is maintained by a small <a href="/authors/editorial-team/">Editorial team</a>. We are independent of OpenAI, Anthropic, Google and other AI providers, and we do not claim professional credentials such as accountancy or financial advice qualifications.</p>
  <p>(The name is a leftover from the site's first life as a calculator site.)</p>
  <h2>How we research cases</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every number links to its source and the date it was reported.</li>
    <li>Each figure is labelled founder-reported, verified, media-reported or unverified (a quoted figure we could not confirm against its original source). If no reliable figure exists we say "Not disclosed" rather than estimate.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Use of AI</h2>
  <p>We use AI tools (large language models) to help draft page text and code. AI output is never published unchecked: facts are checked against the cited sources before publishing. Read more in our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
